WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.800
In 2027 it comes to the Kingdom - from the seventh of January to the fifth of February.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.400
Twenty-four nations, in six groups, playing fifty-one matches.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.300
Saudi Arabia plays in Group A.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.600
Fans will come from every corner of Asia and the world - and many of them live here already.
